#. Description of the plugin
#: vn-address-woocommerce.php
msgid ""
"Integrates the latest Vietnamese administrative addresses into WooCommerce. "
"Supports converting old addresses to new addresses."
msgstr ""
"Integriert die neuesten vietnamesischen Verwaltungsadressen in WooCommerce. "
"Unterstützt die Umwandlung alter Adressen in neue Adressen."

