#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:246
msgid ""
"Uses the Select2 dropdown already bundled with WooCommerce, so it works "
"alongside your theme without adding extra scripts. Turn this off if a theme "
"or another plugin visibly conflicts with it - the fields still work normally "
"as plain dropdowns either way. Only affects Classic Checkout; Block Checkout "
"already has its own searchable ward field."
msgstr ""
"Verwendet die bereits in WooCommerce enthaltene Select2-Bibliothek, ohne "
"zusätzliche Skripte, für eine gute Theme-Kompatibilität. Deaktivieren Sie "
"diese Option, falls es zu sichtbaren Konflikten mit einem Theme oder einem "
"anderen Plugin kommt - die Felder funktionieren dann weiterhin als normale "
"Auswahlfelder. Betrifft nur den Classic Checkout; der Block Checkout verfügt "
"bereits über ein eigenes durchsuchbares Gemeinde-Feld."

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:253
msgid "API Server"
msgstr "API-Server"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:269
msgid ""
"Keep the default address filled in here to get administrative address "
"changes (province/ward renames, boundary updates) as soon as they're "
"published, without needing to update the plugin itself. Checkout still works "
"even if this is left blank or the server is temporarily unreachable - the "
"plugin automatically falls back to the data bundled with the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Wir empfehlen, den Standard-API-Server des Plugins beizubehalten, um die "
"neuesten Änderungen der vietnamesischen Verwaltungsadressen zu erhalten."

